data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The App.jsx doesn't vertically center the content. The Page component alone doesn't center. I should send rework to add vertical centering. However, I need to balance: the core functionality works, but the design explicitly says vertical centering. As orchestrator, I should hold the developer to the design.\n\nBut I also need to consider time. The deadline is 2026-09-21T04:45:22Z which is about 2 hours from now (current time 02:47). I have time for one rework cycle.\n\nLet me check the Page component behavior. The Page component provides padding and centers horizontally via max-width, but doesn't vertically center. The design says to center vertically and horizontally. The developer didn't do vertical centering.\n\nActually, looking at the screenshot again, the Page content area might not fill the viewport. The card is right under the header. The design said \"The page content area fills the available viewport height between the header and footer.\" This is also not met.\n\nI should send rework. But I want to be efficient. The main issue is vertical centering and full height. I can tell the developer to:\n1. Make the Page content area fill available height between header and footer\n2. Center the Card both vertically and horizontally in that area\n3. Use flex layout with Page or a wrapper div to achieve this\n\nLet me send rework."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959245,"id":"chatcmpl-8e305b804969406c8d5532ec93625a23","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

